    for each (even if this card leaves the field). During your opponent''s turn,
    if "Vijam the Cubic Seed" is Special Summoned by the effect of a "Cubic" monster:
    Send this card to the Graveyard, and if you do, halve your opponent''s LP. You
    can banish this card from your Graveyard; add 1 "Cubic" monster from your Deck
    to your hand.'
